{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e862418ea90fbeea30ded6022988c69d1b0562a2e498cdc39ba3f486e3aa7209", "ja": "（今日は新曲のPV撮影だ。\nもうすぐ休憩が終わるが、朋花の姿が見当たらない）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄新曲的PV。\n马上就要结束休息了，却找不到朋花的身影。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "90a6f29c97f8d40bdb8d0fa766ace832cf20ca11da45f5458c4b57bb37f7f8be", "ja": "……うふふっ。\n喜んでくれるといいですね……。", "zh": "……呵呵。\n要是大家能开心就好了呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0607098d691a726e9373c5362a984fb47cf263ed3c7eb186653986e24cc9b72c", "ja": "お疲れさま、朋花。\nこんなところで何してたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，朋花。\n你在这种地方做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "a4cc5880bfc2f58c3d6f0616272f61d5dbdfca25f53c239bafaf6842979841bc", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん～。\n子豚ちゃん達に手紙を書いていたんです。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生～。\n我正在给小猪仔们写信呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "27173ab8ccd88e6a69fcac27c9586f29a5bb1a6babc265b9232e212384234a40", "ja": "ファンレターの返信ですよ～。\n公演に来られない子豚ちゃんもいますからね～。", "zh": "这是粉丝来信的回信哦～  \n因为也有些小猪们没法来看演出呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "516d9be273c96861c2ba6adc97defbc2e70095c122b61d9abfb821f193c79921", "ja": "少しでも多くの子豚ちゃんが救われればと思いまして。\n後でチェックしておいてくださいね～？", "zh": "只要能拯救哪怕多一只的小猪崽也好呀。\n之后请帮我确认一下哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1006_p", "source_sha256": "547b155d0bce01f77120223310c50a28b0308af51329a7ca05ea4115d38695ff", "ja": "なるほどな。朋花らしいファンサービスだ！\nん？　なんだか、良い匂いが……。", "zh": "原来如此，很有朋花风格的粉丝服务！\n嗯？好像闻到了什么香味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "f97467f3bd0e50f0cfae9aea4210b7ac7c656a9dcace026104ccf2a9593fa139", "ja": "それは、この便箋の香りですね～。\n可憐さんオススメの香りを移してみたんです。", "zh": "那是这张信纸的香味哦～。\n我试着把可怜小姐推荐的香味转移上去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "2b9256870d0641a5d55d758339c0d623c4bf96c29871785af3ba62fc73673192", "ja": "手書きの手紙という素敵なアイディアは、\n千鶴さんが提案してくれたんです～。", "zh": "亲笔手写信这个绝妙的主意，\n是千鹤小姐向我提议的哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "19782e152da5f196ff85f90b00ffd77c7c722346ea40cf83e90789852f1c4920", "ja": "おふたりに手紙のことを話したら、子豚ちゃん達が\n喜んでくれる方法を一緒に考えてくれたんですよ～。", "zh": "我跟两位提起写信的事后，两位就和我一起想了个能让小猪们开心的办法哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4e3ef8f158e32c6fd9c5862044d5671dc24a5554d0df036926884c8d2b286822", "ja": "そうだったのか。離れていても、\n朋花を近くに感じてもらえるいいアイデアだな。", "zh": "原来如此。即使相隔两地，也能让大家感受到朋花就在身边，真是个好主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "3835794746ae43f7c20c3555ef176dd59acf62931fbba7372b933e5247c3fc76", "ja": "はい、私もそう思います。\nでも……まだわかっていないみたいですね～？", "zh": "是的，我也是这么想的。\n不过……看来您还没明白呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "74cca3f15af6bbc6d5469dfc012a0cf151b993a4e711664508b1410864536c02", "ja": "子豚ちゃん達のためのアイディアを出すのは、\n{$P$}さんの役目ですよ～。", "zh": "为小猪仔们出谋划策，\n可是{$P$}先生的职责哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "b96a22c8ea96df2b56eb90592596c873c2450d9840dbe4528a61abd48b67a4a0", "ja": "救いを求める子豚ちゃんは、まだたくさんいるのに。\nこれはお仕置きが必要でしょうか～？ うふふ……。", "zh": "明明还有很多渴求拯救的小猪仔呢。\n看来有必要施加惩罚了吗～？呵呵……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1014_p", "source_sha256": "bcadcb45266f6d758ca84f1a1e9e9d9f90547eee58ced56888f478928e432990", "ja": "ぐっ……このプレッシャー……！\n朋花、今日はかなり調子がいいみたいだな……。", "zh": "唔……这股压力……！\n朋花今天状态似乎相当不错啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0d7f8c1b3b55b9b19be107e4a73ec97ef0b508b0704b8b548668f39626334792", "ja": "わかった！　ちゃんと考えるから、\n今日のところは許してくれ。もう撮影も始まるし、な？", "zh": "我知道了！我会好好考虑的，\n今天就先饶了我吧。而且拍摄也要开始了，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0213_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "ddfc614489f2dff6740861e9e28af35248dc9c2ddd0e27389a08184e8ae5f9f5", "ja": "……仕方ありませんね～。撮影が終わったら、一緒に\n考えてくださいね？　聖母との約束ですよ……うふっ♪", "zh": "……真拿您没办法呢～。等拍摄结束之后，\n要和我一起思考哦？这可是与圣母的约定呢……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
